ites ⭐\n\n⚡ Dive into Anime Crusaders, an exciting all anime tower defense adventure game.⚡\n\nA catastrophic event has occurred that summoned countless threats in multiple worlds... but it also brought all the heroes together, and they need your help! 😱\nCan you summon the strongest heroes and save these worlds together? 👊\n\n✨Collect powerful, unique characters to help you fight!\n⚔️Lead a team of anime units to defend against waves of enemies, tower defense style!\n💪Level up your units to unlock amazing abilities and build your own unique squad!\n\n❤️ Join our communications server to stay updated with exclusive codes, news, and sneak peeks. ❤️\n\n⭐ Join the group and like the game for an extra 500 starting GEMS + REROLLS!⭐\nDon't forget to leave a 👍 and ⭐.","path":"/game/107573139811370-anime-crusaders","slug":"107573139811370-anime-crusaders","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9a75bd64a682728a6394de89de395e4d885df26bc00fdaf50c1b98c4bdb28a02.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6250be94224f07e8eff5c449fa30d36f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":117559619,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-04T03:23:40.153Z","creator":{"name":"32x","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":5,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":105716258039711,"name":"[UPDATE 5] Anime Advance🎅","desc":"🎮 Welcome to Anime Advance!\n\n🎯 20K LIKE = NEW CODE !!!\n\n🌍 Explore worlds inspired by your favorite anime and experience epic adventures!\n💥 Defeat enemies to collect stars and unlock new avatars!\n🏆 Play with your friends and complete challenges together - rewards are shared across all game modes!\n\n📱 Available on PC, Mobile, Tablet, and Console!\n\n⭐ Created with ❤️ by StarX","path":"/game/105716258039711-anime-advance","slug":"105716258039711-anime-advance","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/00d44811051509b5b948375cc978b57b15c5a78b667f777e303caadf751f9a8e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ef6b89997fa85a15efad44ad7199fcb9/150/